  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">讓疑心砂與疑心礫石具備發光輪廓，以便更輕鬆地進行考古活動，並希望能降低在挖掘時不慎破壞這些方塊的機率。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#f00\">!免責聲明！</span>發光與相連紋理功能需要&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fdownloads\" rel=\"nofollow\">Optifine</a> 或&nbsp;任何運作機制相同的 CTM 移植版。若為 Fabric 使用者，推薦安裝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/continuity\" rel=\"nofollow\">Continuity</a>。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/985213811055263834/1126099301903388672/2023-07-05_05.18.27.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1845\" height=\"1038\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/985213811055263834/1126099302998097980/2023-07-05_05.26.41.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1845\" height=\"1038\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/985213811055263834/1126099302226346045/2023-07-05_05.19.01.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1845\" height=\"1038\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/985213811055263834/1126099302599630938/2023-07-05_05.21.44.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1845\" height=\"1038\"></span></p>",
